{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"c95677ce2b0dc41257abccef24fe62f02ce6585e17e1dce250fa7bd081353baa","digest":{"component_or_area":"review-bot test harness","key_entities":["SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_SECONDS","DEFAULT_SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_SECONDS","tests/conftest.py","_bound_review_bot_shutdown_drain","tests/unit/test_review_bot.py","_safe_review_bot_lifespan_defaults","reconcile.reconcile_loop","rebar._snapshot.start_background_janitor","shutdown_drain_seconds()","src/rebar/review_bot/config.py"],"problem_keywords":["test lifespan","shutdown drain","long-running test","background reconciler","snapshot janitor","ASGI lifespan","TestClient"],"propositions":["Unit tests entering the review-bot ASGI lifespan inherit the production 1200-second shutdown drain default, causing tests to hang or run long-running background reconciliation and janitor tasks unintentionally.","The test harness must globally bound shutdown_drain_seconds to 1.0 for all tests and stub the reconciler and janitor by default, while allowing explicit opt-in to the real reconcile_loop via a marker.","A test-local SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_SECONDS override must take precedence over the suite-wide 1.0 baseline to enable per-test tuning (e.g., 0.1 for retrigger module tests).","The production DEFAULT_SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_SECONDS=1200 constant and shutdown_drain_seconds() function must remain unchanged; no production files are modified."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787396199535174001,"uuid":"211cd28e-c0a2-42e7-90aa-d0111ef19dfc"}